        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;About a month before Christmas, Catra makes a special purchase for both her and Adora to enjoy together. Things only escalate from there; soon it's three weeks from the holiday, they've both agreed to hold off on having sex until they celebrate on Christmas Eve, and Adora might lose it if Catra does one more thing to tease her. Which Catra will, of course. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But Catra gets a reminder that Adora can give as well as she gets. And 'tis the season for giving!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updated on 2/14/2021: It's Valentine's Day and Catra is estatic- Adora has agreed to switch things up for the holiday, in a way that will leave her just begging for more.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
